+# Async Runtime Policy
+
+This project (Gin, a Go web framework) has no recorded decision on an async runtime. A search of the repository's documentation, changelog, and commit history turned up no policy or decision record specifying an async runtime choice; concurrency in this codebase is handled with Go's native goroutines rather than a separate, selectable async runtime, and no current documentation designates one.
